#!/bin/sh
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
set -eu
case "$#:${1-}" in
0:|1:--help|1:help)
    cat <<'EOF'
mnOS — command guide (English)

  help                      Show this English guide
  help -cn                  Show the Chinese guide
  kernel help               Kernel administration commands in English
  kernel help -cn            Kernel administration commands in Chinese
  kernel info               Show kernel version and online CPUs
  kernel memory             Show physical memory information
  kernel gpu                Show the bound graphics driver
  kernel sysctl KEY         Read a Linux kernel parameter
  sudo kernel set KEY=VALUE  Change a runtime Linux kernel parameter
  nano FILE                 Edit a personal file in the terminal
  code DIRECTORY            Open a project in official Visual Studio Code
  thunar                    Open the graphical file manager
  mnos-net help             Network capabilities and supported tools
  mnos-center               Open the system and tools center
  xfce4-settings-manager    Open desktop settings
  xfce4-display-settings    Change resolution, scaling and displays
  xfdesktop-settings        Change wallpaper and desktop options
  mnos-security-check       Inspect current security settings
  mnfs                      Show the MNFS disk-image command guide

Use the application menu for Firefox, CTF tools and system utilities.
Python is included for tools that need it. Read-only kernel queries run as your
normal account. Changes to modules, parameters, CPU state and TuneD profiles
require sudo. Restricted logs/parameters retain Linux access checks.
The bin command dispatches changes to /usr/sbin/mnos-kernel-admin, which checks
root credentials itself. Neither executable is setuid or elevates automatically.
"help cd" still opens Bash's built-in command documentation.
File editing, applications, project builds and personal desktop settings run as
your normal user. C/C++, Node.js/npm, Go, Rust/Cargo and Java are included.
Installation can optionally authorize your account for NET_ADMIN/NET_RAW via
mnos-net nmap|tcpdump|ip|tc|iw. The default requires sudo for privileged network
operations; ordinary networking and nmap -sT do not need root.

On x86_64 the boot menu offers two independent environments: the original
experimental mnOS kernel and this Linux desktop. ARM64 currently provides the
Linux desktop; the original kernel has not been ported. Native commands include kernel info, kernel
memory, kernel cpu, kernel gpu, fs, ls, cat, write and snapshot. The native F7
page changes supported QEMU display modes and wallpaper. Native accounts are
created on first boot and saved on an attached MNFS disk (otherwise temporary).
Use su for root, exit to return, passwd to change your password and logout to
lock. Own-home files and display settings do not require root. See README.md
and native/FILESYSTEM.md in /usr/src/mnos-native for exact limits.
EOF
    ;;
1:-cn)
    cat <<'EOF'
mnOS — 中文命令帮助

  help                      英文帮助（默认）
  help -cn                  中文帮助
  kernel help               内核管理命令的英文说明
  kernel help -cn            内核管理命令的中文说明
  kernel info               查看内核版本和在线 CPU
  kernel memory             查看物理内存信息
  kernel gpu                查看绑定的显卡驱动
  kernel sysctl 参数名       读取 Linux 内核参数
  sudo kernel set 参数名=值  修改运行时 Linux 内核参数
  nano 文件                 在终端编辑个人文件
  code 项目目录             打开官方 Visual Studio Code 图形编辑器
  thunar                    打开图形文件管理器
  mnos-net help             网络授权模式与工具用法
  mnos-center               打开系统与工具中心
  xfce4-settings-manager    打开桌面设置
  xfce4-display-settings    调整分辨率、缩放和多显示器
  xfdesktop-settings        更换壁纸及桌面选项
  mnos-security-check       检查当前安全配置
  mnfs                      查看 MNFS 磁盘镜像工具用法

Firefox、CTF 工具和系统工具可从应用菜单打开。Python 保留，供相关工具使用。
查询以普通用户运行；修改模块、参数、CPU 状态和 TuneD 配置时才需要 sudo。
受限制的日志和参数仍遵循 Linux 权限。/usr/bin/kernel 把管理操作交给
/usr/sbin/mnos-kernel-admin，后者自行检查 root 身份。两者均无 setuid，
不会自动提权。help cd 仍可查看 Bash 内建命令说明。
编辑个人文件、启动应用、编译项目和个人桌面设置都以普通用户运行。
包含 C/C++、Node.js/npm、Go、Rust/Cargo 和 Java 工具链。
安装时可选通过 mnos-net 向本账号开放 NET_ADMIN/NET_RAW，支持 nmap、tcpdump、
ip、tc、iw。默认特权网络操作需要 sudo；普通联网和 nmap -sT 不需要 root。

x86_64 启动菜单中的自研内核和 Linux 桌面是两个独立环境；ARM64 目前提供
Linux 桌面，自研内核尚未移植。原生内核支持 kernel info、
kernel memory、kernel cpu、kernel gpu，以及 fs、ls、cat、write、snapshot。
原生首次启动创建普通用户及 root 密码；账号保存在已挂载的 MNFS 磁盘，无磁盘
时只在本次启动有效。su 切换 root，exit 返回，passwd 改密码，logout 锁定。
个人目录读写、F7 分辨率和壁纸设置无需 root。具体能力与限制请查阅
/usr/src/mnos-native 下的 README.md 和 FILESYSTEM.md。
EOF
    ;;
*) printf 'Usage: help [-cn]\n' >&2; exit 2 ;;
esac
